<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en"><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://ogunleyemma1.github.io/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/><link href="https://ogunleyemma1.github.io/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="en"/><updated>2026-11-25T05:13:36+00:00</updated><id>https://ogunleyemma1.github.io/feed.xml</id><title type="html">blank</title><subtitle>A simple, whitespace theme for academics. Based on [*folio](https://github.com/bogoli/-folio) design. </subtitle><entry><title type="html">IFMA World Workplace 2026: Scholarship, Ignite Competition, and Meaningful Connections</title><link href="https://ogunleyemma1.github.io/blog/2026/ifma-world-workplace/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="IFMA World Workplace 2026: Scholarship, Ignite Competition, and Meaningful Connections"/><published>2026-11-20T06:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-11-20T06:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://ogunleyemma1.github.io/blog/2026/ifma-world-workplace</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://ogunleyemma1.github.io/blog/2026/ifma-world-workplace/"><![CDATA[<p>Grateful for the opportunity to attend <strong>IFMA World Workplace 2026</strong> in Anaheim, California — one of the premier global gatherings at the intersection of facility management, sustainable infrastructure, and the future of the built environment.</p> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/1-big-screen-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/1-big-screen-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/1-big-screen-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/1-big-screen.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" alt="Olubunmi Ogunleye featured on the main stage screen at IFMA World Workplace 2026 receiving the George Graves Scholarship" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; document.querySelectorAll('.responsive-img-srcset').forEach(function (n) { n.remove(); });"/> </picture> <figcaption class="caption">Honored to be recognized on the main stage at IFMA World Workplace 2026 — receiving the George Graves Scholarship through the IFMA Foundation.</figcaption> </figure> <h2 id="scholarship-recognition">Scholarship Recognition</h2> <p>It was a humbling moment to be featured on the main stage as a recipient of the <strong>George Graves Scholarship</strong> and the <strong>IFMA Houston Chapter Scholarship</strong>, both awarded through the <a href="https://www.ifmafoundation.org/">IFMA Foundation</a>. I am deeply grateful to these organizations for their generous support and investment in the next generation of professionals.</p> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/2-certificate-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/2-certificate-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/2-certificate-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/2-certificate.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" alt="Scholarship award ceremony with certificate" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; document.querySelectorAll('.responsive-img-srcset').forEach(function (n) { n.remove(); });"/> </picture> <figcaption class="caption">Scholarship awardees at IFMA World Workplace 2026.</figcaption> </figure> <h2 id="ignite-competition">Ignite Competition</h2> <p>One of the most energizing experiences at the conference was participating in the <strong>Ignite competition</strong> — a fast-paced presentation format where each speaker communicates their ideas to a live audience. It was a great opportunity to sharpen my ability to convey complex research concepts clearly and concisely to an interdisciplinary crowd.</p> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/3-ignite-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/3-ignite-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/3-ignite-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/3-ignite.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" alt="Presenting at the Ignite competition at IFMA World Workplace 2026" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; document.querySelectorAll('.responsive-img-srcset').forEach(function (n) { n.remove(); });"/> </picture> <figcaption class="caption">Presenting at the Ignite competition — communicating research ideas to a live audience of facility management professionals and researchers.</figcaption> </figure> <h2 id="networking-and-connections">Networking and Connections</h2> <p>Beyond the formal sessions, the most rewarding part of the conference was the people — industry professionals, researchers, and students all advancing conversations around sustainable infrastructure, innovation, and the future of the built environment.</p> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/4-friends1-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/4-friends1-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/4-friends1-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/4-friends1.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" alt="Networking with colleagues at IFMA World Workplace 2026" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; document.querySelectorAll('.responsive-img-srcset').forEach(function (n) { n.remove(); });"/> </picture> </figure> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/5-friends2-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/5-friends2-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/5-friends2-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/5-friends2.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" alt="With friends and colleagues at IFMA World Workplace 2026" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; document.querySelectorAll('.responsive-img-srcset').forEach(function (n) { n.remove(); });"/> </picture> </figure> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/6-heic3-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/6-heic3-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/6-heic3-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/6-heic3.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" alt="Connecting with professionals at IFMA World Workplace 2026" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; document.querySelectorAll('.responsive-img-srcset').forEach(function (n) { n.remove(); });"/> </picture> </figure> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/7-heic5-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/7-heic5-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/7-heic5-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/blog/ifma2026/7-heic5.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" alt="With fellow scholars and attendees at IFMA World Workplace 2026" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; document.querySelectorAll('.responsive-img-srcset').forEach(function (n) { n.remove(); });"/> </picture> <figcaption class="caption">Building meaningful connections with fellow scholars, researchers, and industry professionals.</figcaption> </figure> <h2 id="reflections">Reflections</h2> <p>One of the highlights of this conference was witnessing how research and industry practice can come together to address real-world challenges — from energy-efficient facilities to resilient infrastructure systems. These conversations directly resonate with my doctoral research at the <a href="https://beck.cive.uh.edu/">Beck Research Group</a> at the University of Houston, where I focus on probabilistic fragility and resilience assessment of electric power distribution networks under wind hazards.</p> <p>I am also deeply grateful to my advisor, <strong>Dr. Abigail L. Beck</strong>, for her continued guidance, encouragement, and support in pursuing opportunities that broaden my research and professional development.</p> <p>I leave Anaheim inspired, grateful, and excited to apply these insights as I continue my doctoral research.</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="conferences"/><category term="conference"/><category term="IFMA"/><category term="scholarship"/><category term="networking"/><category term="facility-management"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Reflections on attending IFMA World Workplace 2026 in Anaheim, California — receiving the George Graves Scholarship, competing in the Ignite competition, and connecting with professionals shaping the future of facility management.]]></summary></entry></feed>